": 28, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "EmptySD3LatentImage"}, "order": 19}, {"mode": 4, "outputs": [{"name": "image_urls", "label": "image_urls", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_urls"}], "size": [270, 58], "pos": [1678.33154296875, 2699.036376953125], "widgets_values": ["F2K_"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 55, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filename_prefix"}], "flags": {}, "id": 52, "type": "SaveImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveImage"}, "order": 38}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["你用的模型\t                                                     选哪个节点？\t\nSDXL / SD1.5\t                                                     Empty Latent Image\t\nSD3 / QWEN / FireRed / Z-Image/FLUX.1\t     EmptySD3LatentImage\t可以使用Empty Latent Image节点不报错  \nFlux.2 / ERNIE-Image                                           Empty Flux 2 Latent\t        \n\nSD3系列的模型在读入latent的时候 下采样是8x 也就是：输入的尺寸是1024  传递给模型采样的latent变为 1024/8 = 128。\n采样在128*128px的latent上进行。完成后vae解码再乘上8 = 128*8 = 1024，最终输出尺寸就是1024*1024px\n\n测试结果：\nFlux.2 klein搭配EmptySD3LatentImage不报错，出图分辨率也正确。\nZ-Image搭配Empty Flux 2 Latent不报错，输出图片分辨率小一半。\n\n错误的案例：\n使用FireRed（小红书的模型，SD3架构），搭配Empty Flux 2 Latent节点（参数是1024*1024px），此时下采样是16，传递给模型的latent = 1024/16 = 64\n模型在64*64px的latent上采样，完成后vae解码（此时vae是sd3架构的vae，也就是8）输出图像就是8*64 = 512px\n也就是最终输出512*512px的图片，和输入的1024*1024px造成差别。\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [713.8085327148438, 303.6438293457031], "pos": [-104.97931671142578, 53.01213836669922], "id": 5, "properties": {}, "order": 20}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "links": [60], "label": "LATENT", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "LATENT"}], "size": [270, 106], "pos": [1106.132568359375, 1418.70385742